  "notes": "**Grade:** exams 30% (three midterms), assignments 25%, lab exercises 20%, final project 15%, quizzes 10%; A 90–100, B 80–90, C 70–80, D 60–70. **Exams:** about 40 minutes, all multiple choice, no AI tools; quizzes and exams can't be taken after their scheduled time (exam make-ups only with a valid excuse). Exam 1 was in class on Canvas with the Respondus LockDown Browser (bring your laptop). **Quizzes:** Sep 25, Sep 28, Oct 26, Oct 28, Nov 13, Nov 16, Nov 30, Dec 2. **Late work:** labs and assignments lose 10% per day (at most 50%) and close after 2 weeks; the final project (due Dec 9) takes no late submissions. **AI tools:** allowed and cited on labs, assignments and the project (restricted in the first half of the term), never on exams or quizzes. **Tools:** Python 3 (Anaconda, Jupyter) with NumPy, pandas and Matplotlib; scikit-learn for machine learning. **Dates:** last day to drop Nov 16 · Thanksgiving Nov 25–29 · last class Dec 2. **Start with Units 11–13 for Exam 3.**",
